                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="episode of this kind."/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock ID="mz_3-124_r7" HPOS="573" VPOS="2527" WIDTH="1782" HEIGHT="499" TAGREFS="TYPE_2">
<Shape>
                        <Polygon POINTS="573 2527 2355 2527 2355 3026 573 3026"/>
                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l37" HPOS="676" VPOS="2540" WIDTH="1662" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="678 2567 2338 2573" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="678 2567 676 2581 2334 2591 2338 2573 2336 2546 678 2540 678 2567"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="“Two sons of the hero came back from the reindeer-pasture. The elder said to the father,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l38" HPOS="569" VPOS="2591" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="570 2620 2336 2616" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="570 2620 570 2636 2332 2638 2336 2616 2330 2591 569 2591 570 2620"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="‘A man of the neighboring camp is pasturing his reindeer on our grounds.’ The father said, ‘Why"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l39" HPOS="569" VPOS="2638" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="44" BASELINE="569 2667 2336 2667" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="569 2667 569 2680 2334 2682 2336 2667 2336 2641 569 2638 569 2667"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="is he angry at us, that he acts in such a manner? This is our fall pasture. Is there not room"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l40" HPOS="569" VPOS="2686" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="43" BASELINE="569 2712 2338 2712" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="569 2712 569 2725 2334 2729 2338 2712 2336 2686 569 2686 569 2712"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="enough farther on? What has angered him?’ Then he said, ‘Take that, and stick it into the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l41" HPOS="569" VPOS="2733" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="569 2760 2340 2760" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="2332 2733 569 2733 569 2760 569 2780 2340 2774 2340 2760 2340 2747 2332 2733"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="ground there.’ He gave them a large arrow with a wooden head. ‘With this I want to recover"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l42" HPOS="569" VPOS="2780" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="43" BASELINE="569 2807 2340 2807" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="569 2807 569 2823 2340 2823 2340 2807 2340 2780 569 2780 569 2807"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="my pasture. This is the sign of interdiction of use.’ They went to the pasture and put the arrow"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l43" HPOS="569" VPOS="2827" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="42" BASELINE="569 2854 2338 2854" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="2332 2827 569 2827 569 2854 569 2868 2334 2869 2338 2854 2336 2830 2332 2827"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="there. In the fall they drove their herd towards that pasture. Then they could not find the arrow."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l44" HPOS="570" VPOS="2869" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="570 2901 2338 2901" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="570 2901 570 2914 2336 2916 2338 2901 2336 2869 570 2869 570 2901"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The other man had taken it away, and the pasture was quite trampled down. At last they found"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l45" HPOS="569" VPOS="2920" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="43" BASELINE="569 2947 2338 2947" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="569 2947 569 2963 2336 2963 2338 2947 2336 2920 569 2920 569 2947"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="an old fireplace, and there a remnant of the arrow, all charred. The man had used it to boil some"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-124_l46" HPOS="567" VPOS="2965" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="64" BASELINE="569 2994 2336 2990" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="569 2994 569 3029 699 3027 701 3027 703 3027 736 3006 871 3018 873 3018 941 3006 1009 3021 1011 3021 1013 3021 1044 3006 1434 3016 1436 3016 1438 3016 1440 3016 1455 3006 1619 3014 1621 3014 1623 3014 1625 3014 1638 3004 1716 3020 1718 3020 1720 3020 1722 3020 1740 3008 1796 3020 1798 3020 2334 3006 2336 2990 2330 2965 567 2967 569 2994"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="soup for himself, so large was the arrow. Some time after that, they pitched their tents in a new"/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
